1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:03,067
Your AirPods can charge inside your friend's case.

2
00:00:03,117 --> 00:00:04,266
But there's a catch.

3
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:07,921
Inside every charging case is a tiny power system.

4
00:00:08,310 --> 00:00:12,957
When the earbuds snap into place, their metal contacts connect to the charging circuit.

5
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:17,941
Power flows from the case's battery, through its circuit board, and into the earbuds.

6
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:22,155
But charging doesn't necessarily mean everything will work normally.

7
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:25,204
A compatible case can charge your AirPods.

8
00:00:25,254 --> 00:00:28,887
But incompatible models may not fit or charge correctly.

9
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:29,691
So yes.

10
00:00:29,741 --> 00:00:33,182
A different compatible case can charge your AirPods.
